{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World is on the edge of Chaos...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Keep edging, it's been worse...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d15147a231b30da779873b0da9efa989.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a Pixel Art adventure with gameplay inspired by great classics like <strong>Megaman</strong> <strong>X</strong>,\u00a0featuring a story based on a <i>D&amp;D</i> campaign that, honestly, only the people who played it still remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Good times\u2026 strawberry milk was cheaper back then.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong><i>AK</i></strong>, a wisecracking bard who constantly breaks the fourth wall (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: It was already broken when I got here!). Explore the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, and look for the perfect heroes for a perfect tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Perfect might be overselling... how about adequate?)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9120ee8e4d59fe9cf5b3eefcb9196d74.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapting a first <i>D&amp;D</i> adventure of an inexperienced Dungeon Master, <strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a first game of an equally\u00a0inexperienced deV! (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: He is obviously talking about himself...)<br>Experience a story created from Friendship, tabletop madness, the dumbest of jokes...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And above all...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PURE OBESSESION FOR A DREAM. (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Yep... the deV is kind of nuts)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/5f58813302104f89311bc59e1c701d14.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/95e032a1447e54226075eb03ffa9a74e.avif?t=1765428762\" width=256 height=128 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/683ba4beb9ba243119e9893019641560.avif?t=1765428762\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the heroes of tomorrow, inspired by the real player characters from that old campaign, where the , now, protagonist AK (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: That's me!!) tries to gather a party epic enough to become legends... and maybe their ballad makes gold &amp; fame enough to pay his tab on his favorite tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(<strong><i>AK:</i></strong>\u00a0If the bard with the flower name can hit the jackpot, I sure can!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/1ec3186a270feea906ee320e6eb62604.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d2f3f5a7fc30e76f1dfc75aabd98caee.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, it is common for adventurers to use sword &amp; sorcery in their travels, with <strong><i>AK</i></strong> is no different.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bard is a wielder of <i>runic magic</i>, a rare and ancient art that demands the understanding of the forgotten texts.(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: That <i>Wizard</i> course finally paid off!)\u00a0<br>With a gameplay inspired by <strong>Megaman X</strong>, unleash the <i>runic magic</i> and mock your enemies  or thunder wave them into oblivion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But be careful! Even ancient powers runs out if you get cocky!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/a8a38a8d4ef80f2f31e73382842d3a13.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.webm?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/ad9a489bd8a5955b8ff1bb8f9ae6b0b9.mp4?t=1765428762\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Despite being <strong><i><u>constantly</u></i></strong> under threat, <strong>Askverg</strong> remains a land full of beauty, and most of this beauty is brought to life through experimental Pixel Art! (AK: Experimental because the dev can\u2019t draw properly!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9e41f13f7e1e1e5a68c2fcc12007590c.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Seriously, if you add us to your wishlist, I'll drink a Strawberry milk in your honor!)</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your hat, tune your instrument, and join the song.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Legends don\u2019t write themselves \u2014 and every good story needs a solid kick to get started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Man... I can't believe he menaged to explain the title)</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Brain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/f48a03098651928e0b1b267e5afa1802ff30422c.jpg"},{"name":"The Muscle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/3e976ba31930fd135f420c3b2df04344cabcb4a8.jpg"},{"name":"The Heart","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/f20f759c00e365e628e75e2b5bd37ee639b70a43.jpg"},{"name":"The Leader","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/e7f90d047d132ee1db80e1e44a70638309638d2f.jpg"},{"name":"The Lancer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/29503b380d255bd52e6f0b64deb9ed9cad76227a.jpg"},{"name":"Uninspired","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/7a0a03ffd0b143963c1bd868b66e617030054637.jpg"},{"name":"A song for the Ages","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/8b7dca6b4999e90d5995e4250bd38efbbd5fa8ba.jpg"},{"name":"No Honor?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/41e6634397648116ae346eac2ba49a61717e9dbe.jpg"},{"name":"Tutorials are for losers!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/19a8325f1a785d736d6b73cd1b329cf8ab0f950c.jpg"},{"name":"Limitless","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4084730/4a7f5d80b06feba86ac12033879bbefc2547e6e2.jpg"}],"total":12},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4084730?t=1765428762","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/c138c3c4b8eec24d25f118f4efbfad70ed4cbd37/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765428762","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/861fb600dd11f9801eb5475ea151a5dabf0474f4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765428762","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/861fb600dd11f9801eb5475ea151a5dabf0474f4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765428762","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"As the name suggests, Ass Kicker is a game that doesn\u2019t hold back on insults. The main character is a douche and uses insults as his main weapon.\r\nHuman enemies will have their minds blown by these insults (literally) \u2014 so expect some blood.\r\nThe dialogue may include a few adult themes or language, but nothing too serious or graphic.\r\nAK is a Deadpool-like character; nothing he says should be taken seriously."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The World is on the edge of Chaos...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0Keep edging, it's been worse...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d15147a231b30da779873b0da9efa989.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Ass Kicker</i></strong> is a Pixel Art adventure with gameplay inspired by great classics like <strong>Megaman</strong> <strong>X</strong>,\u00a0featuring a story based on a <i>D&amp;D</i> campaign that, honestly, only the people who played it still remember.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: Good times\u2026 strawberry milk was cheaper back then.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the role of <strong><i>AK</i></strong>, a wisecracking bard who constantly breaks the fourth wall (<strong><i>AK</i></strong>: It was already broken when I got here!). Explore the land of <strong><i>Askverg</i></strong>, and look for the perfect heroes for a perfect tale!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>(<strong>AK</strong>: Perfect might be overselling... how about adequate?)</i><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/99e5f8cf7a9cb163ee63446ff6580025.avif?t=1765428762\" width=64 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>What awaits you:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/9120ee8e4d59fe9cf5b3eefcb9196d74.avif?t=1765428762\" width=600 height=100 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813bfb2c9015343ec2d5ca.poster.avif?t=1765428762\" width=512 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4084730/extras/d400a6b23e813